# =============================================================================
# CONFIDENTIAL — Training material must NEVER appear in any search engine.
#
# Canonical location for ALL training material is the separate Pages project
# served at training.beehivestrategy.com. The legacy copies still sitting under
# /training/ on this marketing site are de-indexed with the rules below.
#
# IMPORTANT — why this is a noindex HEADER and not a robots.txt Disallow:
# if you Disallow a path, crawlers never fetch it, so they never see the
# noindex instruction, and URLs already listed in our sitemap can remain
# indexed indefinitely. Allowing the crawl while returning the
# "X-Robots-Tag: noindex" header is the only reliable way to get a page
# REMOVED from an index. Pair this with removing these URLs from the sitemap.
#
# Wildcards are required — the bare-path cache rules above do not cover deep
# pages such as /training/workbuddy.html or /training/opc/.
# =============================================================================
/training
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
/training/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
/zh-cn/training
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
/zh-cn/training/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
/zh-tw/training
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
/zh-tw/training/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex

